  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zenon Dance Youth Outreach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zenon Dance School&apos;s Youth Outreach Project will provide over 100 youth dancers, ages 3-18 with access to high-quality youth dance classes for one-year at Zenon&apos;s Minneapolis, Minnesota dance studios, and at off-site partnerships with local public schools and arts organizations. Access to dance for young dancers is more important than ever, enabling young people to communicate across economic, racial and gender lines - building respect and understanding in a our challenging world.</narrative>
  </description>
